#!name=Yahoo Mail 广告补充（Google，全设备生效）
#!desc=可选：拦截本次抓包中出现的 Google 广告主机。会影响其他 App 使用这些主机的广告及广告跳转；与 Yahoo Mail 主模块分别启用。不需要 MITM。
# Version: 1.0.0 / 2026-11-09
# These requests were observed on the phone; attribution of every request
# to Yahoo Mail has not been confirmed. Enable only if this scope is desired.
# Domain blocking cannot be limited to Yahoo Mail on iOS.

[Rule]
DOMAIN,pubads.g.doubleclick-cn.net,REJECT
DOMAIN,googleads.g.doubleclick-cn.net,REJECT
DOMAIN,adx.g.doubleclick-cn.net,REJECT
DOMAIN,pagead2.googlesyndication.com,REJECT
